SUMMARY:The Mitchell Thomas Band w/ Moods of Melody at The Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:Mitchell Thomas is a Petaluma-based multi-instrumentalist\, singer\, and songwriter blendingrock\, jazz\, and world music. Known for his technical skill as a guitarist and producer\, he has released original work including the albums MT and A Maze In Grace (20th Anniversary Edition). He also provides guitar lessons via his YouTube channel! \nMOODS OF MELODY is a versatile musical group/band drawing inspiration from artists like Sublime\, Bob Marley\, and Jack Johnson. Known for blending rock\, jazz\, and world music elements\, they frequently perform in the Northern California region.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-mitchell-thomas-band-w-moods-of-melody-at-the-penngrove-pub/
LOCATION:Penngrove Pub\, 10005 Main Street\, Penngrove\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
