SUMMARY:Court ‘n’ Disaster at The California Theatre of Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:Honky tonk meets rock ’n’ roll! Court ‘n’ Disaster delivers high-energy tunes\, tight harmonies\, and plenty of laughs.\nSonoma County’s Court ‘n’ Disaster brings a lively mix of rock and country\, blending decades of honky tonk tradition with sharp musicianship and a healthy dose of humor. With rich vocal harmonies\, standout instrumental work\, and plenty of storytelling\, the band delivers a high-steppin’\, rock-and-rollickin’ good time.\nMade up of an eclectic group of professionals\, lawyers\, a judge\, an educator\, and more\, Court ‘n’ Disaster is as entertaining offstage as they are on. Their shared love of classic country and rock fuels an unforgettable live show full of personality\, talent\, and unexpected charm. \nDoors Open: 6:30 PM | Show Starts: 7:30 PM\nTickets $12 in advance. $18 at door
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/court-n-disaster/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Courtn-Disaster.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The California Theatre of Santa Rosa 528 7th Street Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=528 7th Street:geo:-122.71621,38.44252
END:VEVENT
