SUMMARY:Occidental World Music & Dance Festival
DESCRIPTION:Saturday May 30 from 10 am – 9 pm: Occidental World Music & Dance Festival! at Occidental Center for the Arts. This joyful\, immersive event brings together extraordinary musicians and dancers from around the world for a day filled with exhilarating performances\, interactive workshops\, and irresistible rhythms. From captivating traditional artistry to innovative contemporary fusion\, the festival invites audiences of all ages to experience the beauty of global cultures up close. With food\, vendors\, community activities\, and plenty of space to dance\, it’s a feast for the senses and a celebration of international unity through music and movement. More Than 40 sessions to choose from! Ticket prices/ Adults $65 through April 30 ;$75 through May 29; $80 at the door ; Kids 12 and under free. Teens 1/2 price/Discount OCA Members at www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org; $80 at the door.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/occidental-world-music-dance-festival-2/
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Ct.\, Occidental
CATEGORIES:Dance Performance,Festival,Kids and Family,Music
