SUMMARY:Pacific Vibration at Brewsters
DESCRIPTION:Pacific Vibration is a premiere ORIGINAL/CONSCIOUS reggae band fronted by PROLIFIC singer-songwriter Kerry Wing (Vocals and Guitar).  The music is upbeat & soulful\, and is driven by their heartfelt songwriting\, vocal harmonies and “lyrics that are aimed to make a change in the world”\, according to Chuck Foster of The Beat Magazine.  Their commitment to their craft is what draws THEIR large and loyal fan base and makes Pacific Vibration’s performances a transcending experience.
