SUMMARY:A Night in Egypt ~ a Destination Gala supporting Forgotten Felines of Sonoma County
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we journey thousands of years back in time and open the first chapter of our new Destination Gala series\, A Night in Egypt. Together\, we’ll celebrate cultures that have long revered cats as guardians\, companions\, and symbols of protection. And with your support\, we’ll fund spay & neuter surgeries\, provide vital medical care\, and prevent future suffering for Sonoma County’s most vulnerable cats. Learn more at: forgottenfelines.com/egypt.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/a-night-in-egypt-a-destination-gala-supporting-forgotten-felines-of-sonoma-county/
LOCATION:The Backdrop\, 1455 Corporate Center Pkwy\, Santa Rosa\, 95407
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
