SUMMARY:Miles Davis at 100: A Centennial Celebration
DESCRIPTION:An immersive experience of visual and performing arts\, including an afternoon lecture presented by Marcus Shelby\, a curated exhibit of art and photographs\, and a performing arts experience with live music and historical video footage. This program celebrates the many facets of the genius of Miles Davis as a musical\, fashion\, art and cultural icon. Join trumpeter Konstantins Jemeljanovs Quintet with special guest saxophonist\, Tom Scott\, as they explore the vivid career of Miles Davis.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/miles-davis-at-100-a-centennial-celebration/
